Description:

Mailbox/set includes omitted defaults (parentId, role, sortOrder) in
created, as RFC 8620 requires.  Email/set rejects an update that changes
an immutable property with invalidProperties, rather than ignoring it.


Documentation:

RFC 8620 section 5.3.


Config changes:

None.


Upgrade instructions:

Clients that sent full Email objects in an Email/set update must send only
the properties they change.


GitHub issue:

None.
